\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 "This is a treasury that documents itself. Every payment FlowVault routes mints its own permanent proof on Xtrata, a financial record that can't be edited or lost. Watch one transaction: 'deposit-and-prove' routes a 5 USDCx sale through FlowVault, splitting to a collaborator, locking a reserve, and inscribing a recursive receipt on Xtrata. One on-chain action. Both or neither. And inside that single transaction, you can see the FlowVault deposit event and the Xtrata mint happening together. Each receipt is stored fully on-chain and linked to the work and the receipt before it. Deposits, splits, time locks, withdrawals. The whole money lifecycle. One verifiable chain. And you don't have to trust us. The verifier re-derives the receipt's hash from on-chain bytes, checks the lineage, matches the amounts to the real FlowVault event, and proves the money and the record were the same transaction. All pass. FlowVault moved the money. Xtrata made it provable forever. One primitive: Royalties today, payroll and DAO treasuries next. That's FlowProof."\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

